# header_checks for the cleanup-submission service (ports 587/465, authenticated clients only).
# Removes information about the sender's device/network before the message leaves the server.
# POSIX regexp: "." also matches the newlines of folded (multi-line) headers.

# The Received header Postfix adds for the authenticated client hop ("with ESMTPSA").
/^Received:.*with ESMTPSA/      IGNORE
# Client IP headers added by some MUAs/webmail software.
/^X-Originating-IP:/            IGNORE
/^X-Forwarded-For:/             IGNORE
# TODO(S5): per-domain option to also strip User-Agent / X-Mailer (settings in the admin UI).
